2.3 Typography System (Metro v4 Equivalents)font-family: 'Segoe UI Light', 'Segoe UI Variable Display', 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, sans-serifALL UI text is LOWERCASE (text-transform: lowercase) — headers, buttons, tabs, nav items (Unless displaying user-generated data or proper noun API data).Hero/Header: 6.5rem, weight 100 (.text-leader equivalent).Sub-headers: 2.2–3rem, weight 300 (.text-subtitle equivalent).Body: 1rem, weight 300.Small/Muted: 0.85rem, weight 400, color var(--text-secondary) (.text-small equivalent).2.4 Layout — Grid System & PanoramaEmulate Metro v4's 12-column flex grid (.row, .cell-1 to .cell-12) via vanilla CSS Grid or Flexbox where necessary within subsections.Main app: horizontally scrolling flex container (width: 100vw; height: 100vh; overflow-x: auto; scroll-snap-type: x mandatory).Gap spacing: strictly use standard multiples (e.g., 10px, 20px, 40px). No arbitrary values.Top nav: fixed .xbox-nav, active item at font-size: 48px; font-weight: 200.2.5 Exhaustive Component Library (Metro v4 Style)Live Tiles:Standard sizes: .tile-small (70x70), .tile-medium (150x150), .tile-wide (310x150), .tile-large (310x310).Solid --accent or Metro color.Elements inside tiles: .badge (bottom right), .branding-bar (bottom left icon/text).Slide/Flip effects: Use pure CSS transitions (transform: translateY(-100%) on hover/interval for live-tile flipping).Click feedback: transform: scale(0.95) with transition: 0.1s.Form Elements (Inputs, Checks, Radios, Switches):Inputs: background: #111111; border: 2px solid #333; height: 36px; padding: 0 8px;. On focus: border-color: var(--accent); background: #ffffff; color: #000000;. Add a clear button (x) strictly aligned to the right.Switches (Toggles): Flat rectangular background. The "thumb" is a solid white square. Checked state fills background with --accent.Checkboxes: Square box border: 2px solid var(--text-dim). Checked state reveals an SVG checkmark, border and fill become --accent.App Bar / Top Nav:Clean, 60px height. Flat background (or transparent in Panorama mode).Hamburger menu (.app-bar-menu) on the far left or right, deploying a flat list.Charms & Subviews (Side Panels):Replaces standard modals.Sliding panels from the right edge (left: 100vw; to left: 0; or left: auto; right: 0; width: 300px;).Must have a transparent dark overlay over the main content (.overlay-dark background: rgba(0,0,0,0.6)).Easing: cubic-bezier(0.1, 0.9, 0.2, 1).Activity & Progress:Linear Progress: height: 4px; background: #333;. Progress value block: background: var(--accent);. No border, no animation on the bar itself, just width transitions.Activity Ring (Metro Spinner): 5-6 small dots rotating in a circle using animation: metro-spin 2s infinite linear;.Dialogs & Windows:If a central dialog must be used (e.g., destructive action warning): Strictly rectangular, heavy solid surface color, border equal to --accent (border: 2px solid var(--accent)). Buttons align to the bottom right.Toasts/Notifies: Rectangle blocks sliding up from bottom: 20px; right: 20px;. Dismiss automatically after 3 seconds.ListViews:Grouped lists: Headers are large, thin weight.Items: .list-item flex container. Thumbnail (left, 50–70px) + content.Selection: On right-click or long-press, items pull slightly down and right, revealing a checkmark badge in the top right corner (Classic Windows 8 Metro behavior).3. Critical Preservation Rules3.1 LocalStorage Keys — DO NOT RENAME OR REMOVEKeyPurposeanilist_tokenOAuth access tokenmetro_themeAccent color hexmetro_theme_nameAccent color name (e.g., 'crimson')theme_modedark or lightmetro_wallpaperWallpaper data URLmetro_wallpaper_nameWallpaper filenameshow_adultAdult content toggletitle_languageTitle language preference3.2 Global JS Variables — DO NOT REMOVEJavaScriptaccessToken          // AniList OAuth token
